TITLE Calcite kinetics, pH 2, 200 C; 1000 s in 100 steps; SI(Witherite)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu   10
    Ba   5
    Cl   30 charge

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 10.0
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step si_witherite
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, SI("Witherite")
END
